OL,3,GNEWSALong delays on M5 after lorry
OL,4,Aoverturns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are severe delays on the M5 after
OL,7,Fa lorry overturned on a motorway slip
OL,8,Froad.
OL,10,FNational Highways said the southbound
OL,11,Fjunction 21 slip road near
OL,12,FWeston-super-Mare was closed while
OL,13,Fclean-up work was underway.
OL,15,FIt told drivers to expect delays of
OL,16,Fabout 79 minutes on the approach, with
OL,17,Fabout six miles of congestion.
OL,19,FFootage posted on social media appeared
OL,20,Fto show emergency service vehicles at
OL,21,Fthe scene of the incident.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
